Specifications. The implementation was written from the published
specifications ITU-T H.222.0 | ISO/IEC 13818-1 and ARIB STD-B10, STD-B24,
STD-B31 and STD-B32, in the editions listed in SPECS.md. The copyright in
those specifications belongs to their publishers (ITU, ISO/IEC, and the
Association of Radio Industries and Businesses, ARIB). The specification
documents and text extractions of them are not distributed with this
product. The SPEC-NOTES.md files, the other documentation and the source
comments contain short quotations from the specifications, each attributed
by clause or table, as commentary on how the text is interpreted.

